{"id": "EUVD-2026-105090", "enisaUuid": "7501138e-7ed6-315c-b438-ab93ae3bfc0b", "description": "SparkyFitness before 0.17.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated users to delete other users' food variants via the DELETE /api/foods/food-variants/:id endpoint. Attackers can use variant IDs from public food read endpoints to delete serving and nutrition variants of publicly shared foods, destroying victims' data.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T15:40:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T16:25:31", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/CodeWithCJ/SparkyFitness/security/advisories/GHSA-qph8-6xrr-7xjw", "https://github.com/CodeWithCJ/SparkyFitness/commit/79215eb4d6dda12262e1bb15b76dceb0e37f6fa1", "https://github.com/CodeWithCJ/SparkyFitness/releases/tag/v0.17.0", "https://github.com/CodeWithCJ/SparkyFitness/blob/v0.16.9/SparkyFitnessServer/services/foodCoreService.ts#L479-L498", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/sparkyfitness-before-0.17.0-missing-authorization-via-food-variants-delete-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-p92j-4g3m-hx3x", "CVE-2026-113612"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ecdf38ea-5ca9-3e4e-86a3-6ddddd217ee9", "product": {"name": "SparkyFitness", "vendor": {"name": "CodeWithCJ"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.17.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e5710134-1a6c-3be1-aaac-1b67f5351eab", "vendor": {"name": "CodeWithCJ"}}], "isExploited": false}